  "description": "Stunning Extra-Large 2 bedroom Period Apartment available to rent in Clontarf. \nMake yourself at home in this unique setting.\n\nStandard features of Occu Verville apartments include: \n- Bespoke, designer furniture packages \n- A-Rated appliances \n- Plenty of storage space \n- Heating and hot water is provided is provided by the latest Dimplex air source heat pump and electric radiator systems, meaning there is just one energy bill! \n\nPlease note that additional mandatory monthly fees may apply, such as parking and or refuse. The leasing team can confirm whether these charges are applicable.\n\nAt Occu, we believe that renting should be better. That's why we're working hard to bring you the best: smarter, benefit focused and centred around the needs of our residents. No uncertainty, no hidden costs, stunning homes (and we'll let your pets move in too!). \nBetter Renting. That's different. \n\nPlease note: BER's range from A2-A3 \nPlease note, photos may not be specific to each available apartment, but all apartments are finished to similar standard. \nOccu PSRA License No: 004136",
